{"unit_id":"haythamat__dsh-client-ui-rtl#card-zh","repo":"haythamat/dsh-client-ui-rtl","commit":"f42014df43d28df6b1dafd301c17d3e15f8f173e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-rtl（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为阿拉伯语、希伯来语等从右向左的文本自动调整显示方向。它以 profile layer 接入 DSH Web，并在浏览器端按文本中的 RTL 与拉丁词数估算方向。主要功能有识别多种 RTL 字符范围、保留作者显式设置的方向、跳过代码和表单等元素，以及通过 MutationObserver 更新流式内容。适合在 DSH Web 中阅读阿拉伯语等混合技术术语的用户。无需额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:10-204","cordis.patch.yml:1-5"]}
{"unit_id":"haythamat__dsh-client-ui-rtl#card-en","repo":"haythamat/dsh-client-ui-rtl","commit":"f42014df43d28df6b1dafd301c17d3e15f8f173e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-client-ui-rtl (DSH web plugin): Sets RTL direction for Arabic, Hebrew and related text by balancing RTL and Latin words. It preserves manual overrides, skips code and form controls, and tracks streamed content. Helps read RTL text mixed with technical terms, with no extra configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:10-204","cordis.patch.yml:1-5"]}
