{"unit_id":"haythamat__dsh-client-ui-rtl#feature-1","repo":"haythamat/dsh-client-ui-rtl","commit":"f42014df43d28df6b1dafd301c17d3e15f8f173e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-rtl 的功能「按词估算方向」：它按空白分隔的词统计 RTL 与拉丁字符，RTL 词占优或平局时将元素设为 rtl。页面段落按自身文本判断，表格和列表按子树判断。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:48-92"]}
{"unit_id":"haythamat__dsh-client-ui-rtl#feature-2","repo":"haythamat/dsh-client-ui-rtl","commit":"f42014df43d28df6b1dafd301c17d3e15f8f173e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-rtl 的功能「跟随动态内容更新」：安装后扫描页面，并观察新增节点和文本变化，在下一帧批量重新判断方向。适用于逐步渲染的消息；停止时会断开观察并移除本插件设置的方向标记。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:96-168"]}
{"unit_id":"haythamat__dsh-client-ui-rtl#feature-3","repo":"haythamat/dsh-client-ui-rtl","commit":"f42014df43d28df6b1dafd301c17d3e15f8f173e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-rtl 的功能「保留特殊内容和手动设置」：代码、表单控件、媒体等元素会被跳过；已经带有作者设置 dir 属性的元素也不会被接管。插件只添加 DOM 方向属性，不插入双向控制字符。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:22-36","lib/client.js:76-92"]}
{"unit_id":"haythamat__dsh-client-ui-rtl#feature-4","repo":"haythamat/dsh-client-ui-rtl","commit":"f42014df43d28df6b1dafd301c17d3e15f8f173e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-rtl 的功能「识别多种 RTL 脚本」：客户端字符范围包含希伯来、阿拉伯、叙利亚、他纳、恩科、撒马利亚等文字区段，涵盖波斯语和乌尔都语使用的阿拉伯字母。页面自动标记方向，无需逐段操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:10-19"]}
{"unit_id":"haythamat__dsh-client-ui-rtl#caveat-1","repo":"haythamat/dsh-client-ui-rtl","commit":"f42014df43d28df6b1dafd301c17d3e15f8f173e","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-client-ui-rtl 使用词数启发式判断方向，短 RTL 语句旁有较长拉丁命令时可能判为左到右；输入框和整体页面布局也不由它调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:48-68","lib/client.js:22-36"]}
